These files are derived from broadinstitute/long-read-pipelines, which is licensed
BSD-3-Clause. Each one's header records the upstream path it came from and every way it
diverges:

    structs/Structs.wdl                          (verbatim)
    tasks/Utility/Utils.wdl                      (two-task subset)
    tasks/Assembly/Flye.wdl
    tasks/Preprocessing/Medaka.wdl
    tasks/QC/Quast.wdl
    tasks/VariantCalling/CallAssemblyVariants.wdl
