These have no upstream counterpart -- their headers say so -- and are covered by this
repository's top-level Apache-2.0 LICENSE, not the notice below:

    tasks/QC/ReadStats.wdl
    pipelines/ONT/Assembly/ONTAssembleCohort.wdl
    smoke/smoke.wdl

The `docker:` runtime attributes in the derived tasks name images published by the Broad
(us.gcr.io/broad-dsp-lrma/lr-*). Those images are referenced, not redistributed here, and
carry their own licensing; this template's default `--container-runtime none` never pulls
them.

The upstream license follows verbatim.

